Z||000015||Wade87GT||05-16-2001||10:17 AM||||Hey bcwawright,<P>You've probably already checked your tire pressures. If not, there's a world of a difference that 4 or 5 psi can make. Try using 32 psi in front. I'm using 225-50-16 tires in front with 32 psi and have no steering troubles at all, and I'm not Mr. Muscles.<BR>||||reg||5
